C<CUSTOMER_CARE>, C<CHARITY_NONPROFIT>, C<DELIVERY_NOTIFICATIONS>,
C<FRAUD_ALERT_MESSAGING>, C<EVENTS>, C<HIGHER_EDUCATION>, C<K12>, C<MARKETING>,
C<POLLING_AND_VOTING_NON_POLITICAL>, C<POLITICAL_ELECTION_CAMPAIGNS>,
C<PUBLIC_SERVICE_ANNOUNCEMENT> or C<SECURITY_ALERT>. An array reference.

=item C<use_case_summary>

Use this to further explain how messaging is used by the business or
organization.

=item C<vetting_id>

The unique ID of the vetting

=item C<vetting_provider>

Must be C<CAMPAIGN_VERIFY>.

=back

=head2 delete

  $client->messaging->v1->tollfree_verifications($sid)->delete;

Delete a tollfree verification. Returns true.

=head1 TollfreeVerificationInstance

See also L<Twilio::InstanceResource>.

It has C<fetch>, C<update> and C<delete>, which work as they do on the context.

Its fields are:

=over

=item account_sid

The SID of the L<Account|https://www.twilio.com/docs/iam/api/account> that
created the Tollfree Verification resource.

=item additional_information

Additional information to be provided for verification.

=item age_gated_content

Indicates if the content is age gated.

=item business_city

The city of the business or organization using the Tollfree number.

=item business_contact_email

The email address of the contact for the business or organization using the
Tollfree number.

=item business_contact_first_name

The first name of the contact for the business or organization using the
Tollfree number.

=item business_contact_last_name

The last name of the contact for the business or organization using the
Tollfree number.

=item business_contact_phone

The E.164 formatted phone number of the contact for the business or
organization using the Tollfree number.

=item business_country

The country of the business or organization using the Tollfree number.

=item business_name

The name of the business or organization using the Tollfree number.

=item business_postal_code

The postal code of the business or organization using the Tollfree number.

=item business_registration_authority

One of C<EIN>, C<CBN>, C<CRN>, C<PROVINCIAL_NUMBER>, C<VAT>, C<ACN>, C<ABN>,
C<BRN>, C<SIREN>, C<SIRET>, C<NZBN>, C<USt-IdNr>, C<CIF>, C<NIF>, C<CNPJ>,
C<UID>, C<NEQ> or C<OTHER>.

=item business_registration_country

Country business is registered in

=item business_registration_number

A legally recognized business registration number

=item business_registration_phone_number

The E.164 formatted number associated with the business.

=item business_state_province_region

The state/province/region of the business or organization using the Tollfree
number.

=item business_street_address

The address of the business or organization using the Tollfree number.

=item business_street_address2

The address of the business or organization using the Tollfree number.

=item business_type

One of C<PRIVATE_PROFIT>, C<PUBLIC_PROFIT>, C<SOLE_PROPRIETOR>, C<NON_PROFIT>
or C<GOVERNMENT>.

=item business_website

The website of the business or organization using the Tollfree number.

=item customer_profile_sid

Customer's Profile Bundle BundleSid.

=item date_created

The date and time in GMT when the resource was created specified in L<ISO
8601|https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/ISO_8601> format. A L<Time::Piece> object in
UTC. See L<Twilio::Deserialize/date_time>.

=item date_updated

The date and time in GMT when the resource was last updated specified in L<ISO
8601|https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/ISO_8601> format. A L<Time::Piece> object in
UTC. See L<Twilio::Deserialize/date_time>.

=item doing_business_as

Trade name, sub entity, or downstream business name of business being submitted
for verification

=item edit_allowed

If a rejected verification is allowed to be edited/resubmitted. Some rejection
reasons allow editing and some do not.

=item edit_expiration

The date and time when the ability to edit a rejected verification expires. A
L<Time::Piece> object in UTC. See L<Twilio::Deserialize/date_time>.

=item error_code

The error code given when a Tollfree Verification has been rejected.

=item external_reference_id

An optional external reference ID supplied by customer and echoed back on
status retrieval.

=item help_message_sample

A sample help message provided to users.

=item message_volume

Estimate monthly volume of messages from the Tollfree Number.

=item notification_email

The email address to receive the notification about the verification result. .

=item opt_in_confirmation_message

The confirmation message sent to users when they opt in to receive messages.

=item opt_in_image_urls

Link to an image that shows the opt-in workflow. Multiple images allowed and
must be a publicly hosted URL.

=item opt_in_keywords

List of keywords that users can send to opt in or out of messages.

=item opt_in_type

One of C<VERBAL>, C<WEB_FORM>, C<PAPER_FORM>, C<VIA_TEXT>, C<MOBILE_QR_CODE>,
C<IMPORT> or C<IMPORT_PLEASE_REPLACE>.

=item privacy_policy_url

The URL to the privacy policy for the business or organization.

=item production_message_sample

An example of message content, i.e. a sample message.

=item regulated_item_sid

The SID of the Regulated Item.

=item rejection_reason

The rejection reason given when a Tollfree Verification has been rejected.

=item rejection_reasons

A list of rejection reasons and codes describing why a Tollfree Verification
has been rejected.

=item resource_links

The URLs of the documents associated with the Tollfree Verification resource.

=item sid

The unique string to identify Tollfree Verification.

=item status

One of C<PENDING_REVIEW>, C<IN_REVIEW>, C<TWILIO_APPROVED> or
C<TWILIO_REJECTED>.

=item terms_and_conditions_url

The URL of the terms and conditions for the business or organization.

=item tollfree_phone_number

The E.164 formatted toll-free phone number associated with the verification.

=item tollfree_phone_number_sid

The SID of the Phone Number associated with the Tollfree Verification.

=item trust_product_sid

Tollfree TrustProduct Bundle BundleSid.

=item url

The absolute URL of the Tollfree Verification resource.

=item use_case_categories

No description in the specification.

=item use_case_summary

Use this to further explain how messaging is used by the business or
organization.

=item vetting_id

No description in the specification.

=item vetting_id_expiration

A L<Time::Piece> object in UTC. See L<Twilio::Deserialize/date_time>.

=item vetting_provider

Must be C<CAMPAIGN_VERIFY>.

=back

